<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>How It Works — Ridgeline Ops</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>How Ridgeline Ops works</h2>
        <p>Three paths, depending on what brought you here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>1. Choose your path</h3>
          <p>Hire an operator, register as one, sign up for training, or rent a machine directly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>2. Submit your request</h3>
          <p>Fill a short form — no account needed. Farmers and operators are matched by machine type and location.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>3. Get to work</h3>
          <p>Operators confirm availability, training sessions get scheduled, and rentals are arranged for delivery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>What people say</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="machine-grid">
        <div class="machine-card">
          <p class="desc" style="font-size: 1rem;">"I hired a tractor operator through Ridgeline Ops during planting season — saved me weeks of waiting."</p>
          <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem;">— Farmer, Kaduna</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="machine-card">
          <p class="desc" style="font-size: 1rem;">"I trained on the boom sprayer and now I get regular hire requests from farmers nearby."</p>
          <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem;">— Operator, Oyo</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="machine-card">
          <p class="desc" style="font-size: 1rem;">"Renting the harvester directly worked out cheaper than hiring for the small plot I had."</p>
          <h3 style="font-size: 0.95rem;">— Farmer, Enugu</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Frequently asked</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>How is the training fee set?</h3>
          <p>Each machine has its own fee based on how complex it is to operate — a power tiller costs less to learn than a combine harvester.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Do I need to own a machine to register as an operator?</h3>
          <p>No — many operators work with machines owned by the farmer or rented through Ridgeline Ops.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Can I rent a machine without an operator?</h3>
          <p>Yes. Renting is separate from hiring — you can rent the equipment and supply your own operator if you prefer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
